## Connect Shapes

```ts
const connector = slide.shapes.connect(sourceShape, targetShape, {
  kind: "elbow",
  fromSide: "right",
  toSide: "left",
  line: { style: "solid", fill: "slate-500", width: 2 },
  head: { type: "arrow", width: "med", length: "med" },
});
